  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Agriculture Development Fund (ADF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ADF is a non-bank executive agency within the Ministry of Agriculture, Irrigation and Livestock. The ADF develops innovative credit products and the capacity for credit service delivery; lends money to agriculture and agribusiness financial and non-financial intermediaries; and, promotes and supports value chain development with analytical work, technical assistance, training and grants.</narrative>
